    <Fragment slot='caption'>
      One URL, <code>/programs/42/reports?q=algebra&amp;page=3</code>, is a complete, serialized
      description of this view: the page, the active tab, the search text, and the pagination all
      resolve from it, on the server, into finished HTML. Anyone opening this link gets exactly this
      screen; nothing about it needs a client fetch or a
